  34:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****         (##) UART pins configuration:
  35:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the UART GPIOs.
  36:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the UART TX/RX pins as alternate function pull-up.
  37:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****         (##) NVIC configuration if you need to use interrupt process (HAL_UART_Transmit_IT()
  38:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_IT() APIs):
  39:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the USARTx interrupt priority.
  40:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the NVIC USART IRQ handle.
  41:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****         (##) DMA Configuration if you need to use DMA process (HAL_UART_Transmit_DMA()
  42:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_DMA() APIs):
  43:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Declare a DMA handle structure for the Tx/Rx stream.
  44:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the DMAx interface clock.
  45:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the declared DMA handle structure with the required
  46:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****                   Tx/Rx parameters.
  47:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the DMA Tx/Rx stream.
  48:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Associate the initialized DMA handle to the UART DMA Tx/Rx handle.
  49:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the priority and enable the NVIC for the transfer complete
  50:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****                   interrupt on the DMA Tx/Rx stream.
  51:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the USARTx interrupt priority and enable the NVIC USART IRQ handle
  52:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****                   (used for last byte sending completion detection in DMA non circular mode)
