  54:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Program the Baud Rate, Word Length, Stop Bit, Parity, Hardware
  55:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****         flow control and Mode(Receiver/Transmitter) in the huart Init structure.
