  58:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****         the HAL_UART_Init() API.
  59:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c **** 
