  62:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  63:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For the LIN mode, initialize the UART registers by calling the HAL_LIN_Init() API.
