  79:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     ##### Callback registration #####
  80:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     ==================================
  81:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  82:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  83:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     The compilation define USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
  84:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
  85:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  86:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  87:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     Use Function HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
  88:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     Function HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
  89:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
  90:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
