2727:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to control the UART:
2728:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) HAL_LIN_SendBreak() API can be helpful to transmit the break character.
2729:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_EnterMuteMode() API can be helpful to enter the UART in mute mode.
2730:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_ExitMuteMode() API can be helpful to exit the UART mute mode by software
2731:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableTransmitter() API to enable the UART transmitter and disables the UART
2732:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableReceiver() API to enable the UART receiver and disables the UART trans
